{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-molecular-strand-partition","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:molecular-strand-partition","kind":"definition","title":"Molecular strand-partition $\\lambda$ of $N$ strands","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-molecular-braid"],"tags":["strand-partition","young-subgroup","composite","molecular","parabolic"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Molecular.StrandPartition","text":"molecular-strand-partition.md","leanSource":"molecular-strand-partition.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:molecular-strand-partition\"></a><p>Let a molecule be assembled from <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code> sub-units carrying strand counts <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_1,\\dots,n_k</code>. The <strong>molecular strand-partition</strong> is the composition</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\lambda = (n_1,\\dots,n_k), \\qquad |\\lambda| = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} n_i = N,</code></pre>\n<p>which records how the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N</code> strands of the composite braid in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_N(q)</code> are distributed among the sub-units. Write <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ell(\\lambda) = k</code> for the number of sub-units.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-strand-partition.md","heading":"Definition","number":"18.2.1","page":"b/def-molecular-strand-partition","qa":{"counts":{"pass":83,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Molecular.StrandPartition","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-strand-partition.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
